orthogonal geometric lens:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"3c387e07-4f5c-3141-a087-1c78502587b8"],

Cell["\<\
certMapFile = FileNameJoin[{repoRoot, \"00-BBT-blackbox-protocol\", \
\"certification_map.png\"}];
certificationMap = If[FileExistsQ[certMapFile], Import[certMapFile], Missing[\
\"regenerate via certification_map.wl\"]];\
