Cell["\<\
Section 3 check: the G7 anchor (axis rank 2, cascade DLA 3, leaf DLA < 3); \
OQ1 separation (orbit rank 2 vs 0, z-column zero); OQ2 forger flagged (D_max \
far above t_max); the CV column (u(2) = 4 confined, sp(4,R) = 10 and sp(2,R) \
= 3 active); and the embedded map.\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"0b61adf2-34ea-ae42-b957-ca4e52d3aba8"],

Cell["\<\
