Cell["\<\
Locate the repository root (this file lives at docs/essay-src/), load the \
BlackBox paclet, and repair any Global`-shadowing of paclet symbols (the \
shadowing pitfall documented in kcbs_circuit.wl \\[LongDash] Get[] avoids it, \
but we de-shadow defensively):\
